      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "notes": "Critical: without alwaysOutputData, a reply from an email with no matching lead (spam, wrong address, cc'd colleague - a normal case) returns 0 rows and kills every downstream node, including the unmatched-reply handling CODE - Check Lead Found was written to support. Same bug class as WF-05's lead lookup.",
